  "description": "Bring warmth, texture, and timeless rustic character to your creative projects with this collection of 12 realistic wood background textures. This versatile bundle features a beautiful variety of wooden plank styles, including warm natural timber, whitewashed boards, weathered gray wood, reclaimed wood, vintage rustic planks, and dark barn wood.\nEach background offers authentic wood grain, natural knots, subtle cracks, aged details, and realistic surface texture, making them ideal for creating a cozy farmhouse, cottage, vintage, rustic, or country-inspired aesthetic. The variety of orientations, tones, and wood finishes gives you plenty of options for matching different design styles and projects.\nPerfect for digital scrapbooking, printable designs, wall art, invitations, stationery, product mockups, social media graphics, backgrounds, branding, DIY projects, sublimation designs, and print-on-demand products.\nThese wood textures can also be used as overlays, digital paper, photo backdrops, website backgrounds, packaging designs, and decorative elements. Whether you are creating farmhouse artwork, rustic wedding stationery, seasonal designs, or vintage-inspired graphics, this collection provides natural-looking wooden surfaces that add depth and character to your work.\nA practical and versatile collection for designers, crafters, photographers, bloggers, and small business owners looking for high-quality rustic wood textures.\nIncludes 12 unique wood background styles designed to give your projects a natural, cozy, and authentic wooden appearance.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Bring warmth, texture, and timeless rustic character to your creative projects with this collection of 12 realistic wood background textures. This versatile bundle features a beautiful variety of wooden plank styles, including warm natural timber, whitewashed boards, weathered gray wood, reclaimed wood, vintage rustic planks, and dark barn wood.</p>\n<p>Each background offers authentic wood grain, natural knots, subtle cracks, aged details, and realistic surface texture, making them ideal for creating a cozy farmhouse, cottage, vintage, rustic, or country-inspired aesthetic. The variety of orientations, tones, and wood finishes gives you plenty of options for matching different design styles and projects.</p>\n<p>Perfect for digital scrapbooking, printable designs, wall art, invitations, stationery, product mockups, social media graphics, backgrounds, branding, DIY projects, sublimation designs, and print-on-demand products.</p>\n<p>These wood textures can also be used as overlays, digital paper, photo backdrops, website backgrounds, packaging designs, and decorative elements. Whether you are creating farmhouse artwork, rustic wedding stationery, seasonal designs, or vintage-inspired graphics, this collection provides natural-looking wooden surfaces that add depth and character to your work.</p>\n<p>A practical and versatile collection for designers, crafters, photographers, bloggers, and small business owners looking for high-quality rustic wood textures.</p>\n<p>Includes 12 unique wood background styles designed to give your projects a natural, cozy, and authentic wooden appearance.</p>",
